  "identity": "Hovering memory guardian assembled from broad blue-black stone tablets around a squat ivory mask with ONE pale cyan vertical eye. Three offset stone memory-ring slabs float behind its head like a broken halo, thick separated forearm blocks and a tapered floating robe of slate segments. A few cyan seams, no text or runes shaped as letters. Curious solemn guardian with comic crooked mask.",
